    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the tyre pressure indicating installation, showing the axle manifold, the gear leg harness hardware and the brake control unit items that changed with the additional sensing input.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "To identify the axle manifold, the harness hardware and the brake control unit items of the tyre pressure indicating installation.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows one main gear position with the wheel removed and sheet 2 the brake control unit bay. Item 40 and item 40A are the brake control unit regulator with and without the additional sensing input; they are the same form and fit and can only be told apart by the label, so the effectivity note must be read before ordering. Six axle manifolds are fitted per aircraft. The wheel-mounted transmitter is supplied with the wheel and is not separately listed here."
    },
